      "createdAt": "2026-10-02T21:39:43.187934005+00:00",
      "description": "Deprecated since essay 1.8.0: write com.semanticops.comments/comment (fields comment_text, kind) and com.semanticops.comments/comments-on instead; this definition is kept only so existing essay comments stay valid. Comment comments on Paragraph (comment → paragraph). Essay-local for now; expected to become a core \"agent commentary on human content\" mechanism when a second consumer appears (owner, 2026-10-02).",
